<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | BookHeaven</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-stone-50 text-stone-800">

    <%- include('includes/nav.ejs') %>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <section class="bg-stone-950 text-white px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <p class="text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-semibold">
                The Story Behind BookHaven
            </p>

            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-3">
                More Than Books. <span class="text-amber-400">A World of Ideas.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="text-stone-300 mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed">
                We believe every book has the power to inspire curiosity,
                encourage learning, and open the door to something new.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Content -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 py-12 md:py-16">

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">

            <!-- Image -->
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute inset-3 bg-amber-400 rounded-2xl rotate-3"></div>

                <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-lg">
                    <img
                        src="/img1.png"
                        alt="A book from the BookHaven collection"
                        class="w-full h-[350px] md:h-[470px] object-contain rounded-xl bg-stone-100"
                    >
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Text -->
            <div class="py-4">
                <p class="text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-semibold">
                    Welcome to BookHaven
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 leading-tight">
                    A Little Place for Your Next Big Idea.
                </h2>

                <p class="text-stone-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-8 mt-6">
                    Our bookstore is made for students and readers who love
                    to learn, explore, and grow every day. We believe books
                    are not just pages—they are tools that open new ideas,
                    improve thinking, and build confidence.
                </p>

                <p class="text-stone-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-8 mt-4">
                    From captivating stories to knowledge-filled books,
                    every title offers an opportunity to discover something
                    meaningful. Whether you are preparing for exams,
                    developing a hobby, or searching for inspiration,
                    our collection is here to support your journey.
                </p>

                <a href="/books"
                   class="inline-block mt-7 bg-stone-950 text-white font-semibold px-7 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-400 hover:text-stone-950 transition">
                    Explore Our Books →
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Our Values -->
        <section class="mt-20">
            <div class="text-center mb-10">
                <p class="text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-semibold">
                    What We Believe
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-3">
                    The Values Behind Every Page
                </h2>

                <p class="text-stone-500 mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                    Reading is a journey, and these are the things that make it worthwhile.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

                <div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl">
                        📚
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">Lifelong Learning</h3>

                    <p class="text-stone-500 leading-7 mt-3">
                        Every book gives us a chance to learn something new
                        and see the world from a different perspective.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl">
                        💡
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">Curiosity & Discovery</h3>

                    <p class="text-stone-500 leading-7 mt-3">
                        We encourage readers to ask questions, discover
                        fresh ideas, and explore beyond the familiar.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl">
                        🌱
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">Personal Growth</h3>

                    <p class="text-stone-500 leading-7 mt-3">
                        The right book can inspire better habits, stronger
                        confidence, and a lifelong love of reading.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Closing Banner -->
        <section class="mt-16 bg-amber-100 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold">
                Your Next Chapter Starts Here.
            </h2>

            <p class="text-stone-600 mt-3">
                Find a book that inspires you to think, dream, and grow.
            </p>

            <a href="/books"
               class="inline-block mt-6 bg-stone-950 text-white px-7 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-stone-800 transition">
                Find Your Next Read
            </a>
        </section>

    </main>

    <%- include('includes/footer.ejs') %>

</body>
</html>
